 "note": "Going loud as a prepared choice (Sky; Motive's plan L4c): the Enforcer brings the car round to the service drive first; Watch and Listen, Inez turned, the patrol rerouted, the camera looped, the guard called off (the false tip on the rival car is retired, 0.41.0). He goes in the quiet way, and with his ring nearly closed the three, set in the yard, open on what comes. Vale into the car on the drive; Go when it is free. Engine 0.41.0 (brief 096): the rival car boxes our car in on arrival; the plan's end gains the block's answer (blow the car once nobody of the crew stands or once Popovic is aboard, and Go once the box is gone), nothing else. Engine 0.42.0: kept as the loud reference (it never uses the lend: no in-car Take); the lend's version is prepared-loud-lend, a variant for Motive (L6 gates Popovic's car). Brief 101 (engine 0.52.0, the square's mast; Motive §3): its waits move with route A's: the Scout watches Inez from her start and the Fixer waits behind the mast where the cell starts, walking in only for the Help (never taped) and from there to her yard post.",
